{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "moves.time_aggregation",
    "description": "Template library: the shapes of MOVES's TIME pre-aggregation (PreAggDAY.sql, PreAggMONTH.sql, PreAggYEAR.sql; InputDataManager.preAggregateExecutionDB) and of its output time step (AggregationSQLGenerator), as `onroad/model.esm` reads them (PLAN.md §7.3.63, docs/esm-conventions.md §115).\n\n`hour_day_day` and `hour_day_hour` unpack a packed hour-day the way every MOVES script does, `mod(hourDayID,10)` and `floor(hourDayID/10)` (AdjustHotelling.sql): PreAggDAY.sql writes `hourDayID = dayID` at hour 0, which no default table holds, so the cell's day and hour cannot be looked up.\n\n`preaggregation_source_type_order` is PreAggDAY.sql's and PreAggMONTH.sql's `SourceTypeOrdering`, the preference by which HourWeighting3 takes ONE source type's travel to weigh the collapsed weather by: 21 first, then by default population, 11 last. It is a constant the scripts write as an INSERT, so it is written here as code (conventions §73); `preaggregation_source_type_order_none` is the place past its end.\n\n`output_step_column` reads one column of the output relation onto the output-time-step relation `outputstep_rows` through the representative cell `mosOutputOrdinal`, as `rate_output_column` reads one onto the Rates relation.\n\n`whole_year_days`, `year_value_or_own` and `month_cell_share` are PreAggYEAR.sql's three kinds of collapse at the Year cell, MonthOfAnyYear 0: a constant the script inserts, a table it replaces by a constant row, and a weighted mean over the RunSpec's months (PLAN.md §7.3.65). `year_captured_process` and `year_captured_pollutant` list what the Year capture checks; `year_captured_species`, `year_captured_idle_species` and `year_captured_minor_species` the species the Year species captures check.\n\n`output_step_month_slots` and `output_step_cell_slots` are how many month and cell slots each (pollutant-process, cohort, county) keeps at the output time step: the months unless `n_outputSumsMonths`; and the (day type, hour) cells at Hour, the day types (`n_rateday`) when `n_outputSumsHours` sums each day's hours (24-Hour Day, Portion of Week), and one when `n_outputSumsDays` sums them all (Month, Year). `outputstep_rows` is sized by the same product, written out because an index-set size is a metaparameter expression (PLAN.md §7.3.66).",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ]
  },
  "expression_templates": {
    "hour_day_day": {
      "params": [
        "hour_day_id"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "-",
        "args": [
          "hour_day_id",
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              10.0,
              {
                "op": "floor",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "/",
                    "args": [
                      "hour_day_id",
                      10.0
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "hour_day_hour": {
      "params": [
        "hour_day_id"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "floor",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              "hour_day_id",
              10.0
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "preaggregation_source_type_order": {
      "params": [
        "source_type_id"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "ifelse",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "==",
            "args": [
              "source_type_id",
              21.0
            ]
          },
          1.0,
          {
            "op": "ifelse",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "==",
                "args": [
                  "source_type_id",
                  31.0
                ]
              },
              2.0,
              {
                "op": "ifelse",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "==",
                    "args": [
                      "source_type_id",
                      32.0
                    ]
                  },
                  3.0,
                  {
                    "op": "ifelse",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "==",
                        "args": [
                          "source_type_id",
                          52.0
                        ]
                      },
                      4.0,
                      {
                        "op": "ifelse",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "==",
                            "args": [
                              "source_type_id",
                              61.0
                            ]
                          },
                          5.0,
                          {
                            "op": "ifelse",
                            "args": [
                              {
                                "op": "==",
                                "args": [
                                  "source_type_id",
                                  54.0
                                ]
                              },
                              6.0,
                              {
                                "op": "ifelse",
                                "args": [
                                  {
                                    "op": "==",
                                    "args": [
                                      "source_type_id",
                                      62.0
                                    ]
                                  },
                                  7.0,
                                  {
                                    "op": "ifelse",
                                    "args": [
                                      {
                                        "op": "==",
                                        "args": [
                                          "source_type_id",
                                          43.0
                                        ]
                                      },
                                      8.0,
                                      {
                                        "op": "ifelse",
                                        "args": [
                                          {
                                            "op": "==",
                                            "args": [
                                              "source_type_id",
                                              53.0
                                            ]
                                          },
                                          9.0,
                                          {
                                            "op": "ifelse",
                                            "args": [
                                              {
                                                "op": "==",
                                                "args": [
                                                  "source_type_id",
                                                  41.0
                                                ]
                                              },
                                              10.0,
                                              {
                                                "op": "ifelse",
                                                "args": [
                                                  {
                                                    "op": "==",
                                                    "args": [
                                                      "source_type_id",
                                                      42.0
                                                    ]
                                                  },
                                                  11.0,
                                                  {
                                                    "op": "ifelse",
                                                    "args": [
                                                      {
                                                        "op": "==",
                                                        "args": [
                                                          "source_type_id",
                                                          51.0
                                                        ]
                                                      },
                                                      12.0,
                                                      {
                                                        "op": "ifelse",
                                                        "args": [
                                                          {
                                                            "op": "==",
                                                            "args": [
                                                              "source_type_id",
                                                              11.0
                                                            ]
                                                          },
                                                          13.0,
                                                          14.0
                                                        ]
                                                      }
                                                    ]
                                                  }
                                                ]
                                              }
                                            ]
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "preaggregation_source_type_order_none": {
      "params": [],
      "body": 14.0
    },
    "output_step_column": {
      "params": [
        "value"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "faq",
        "args": [],
        "semiring": "sum_product",
        "output_idx": [
          "x"
        ],
        "ranges": {
          "x": {
            "from": "outputstep_rows"
          },
          "o": {
            "from": "output_rows"
          }
        },
        "join": [
          {
            "on": [
              [
                "mosOutputOrdinal",
                "outOrdinal"
              ]
            ]
          }
        ],
        "expr": {
          "op": "index",
          "args": [
            "value",
            "o"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "output_step_month_slots": {
      "params": [],
      "body": {
        "op": "-",
        "args": [
          "n_runspecmonth",
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "n_outputSumsMonths",
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  "n_runspecmonth",
                  1
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "output_step_cell_slots": {
      "params": [],
      "body": {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
          "n_outputSumsDays",
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  1,
                  "n_outputSumsDays"
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  "n_runspecday",
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      "n_outputSumsHours",
                      {
                        "op": "-",
                        "args": [
                          "n_runspecday",
                          "n_rateday"
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "whole_year_days": {
      "description": "PreAggYEAR.sql's `INSERT INTO MonthOfAnyYear VALUES (0, \"Whole Year\", 365, 0)`: the days of the one month a Year-aggregated run has, so its weeks per month are 365/7. A constant the script writes, so it is written here as code (conventions §73).",
      "params": [],
      "body": 365.0
    },
    "year_value_or_own": {
      "description": "A table PreAggYEAR.sql REPLACES with a constant row at MonthOfAnyYear 0 (MonthVMTFraction 1.0, StartsMonthAdjust 1, HotellingMonthAdjust 1.0, MonthOfAnyYear's 365 days): `year_value` when the run aggregates by year (`aggregates_months`, `n_aggregatesMonths`), and the table's own row at the cell's month otherwise.",
      "params": [
        "aggregates_months",
        "year_value",
        "own_value"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "ifelse",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": ">",
            "args": [
              "aggregates_months",
              0.5
            ]
          },
          "year_value",
          "own_value"
        ]
      }
    },
    "month_cell_share": {
      "description": "An aggregation month's share of a month cell for a table PreAggYEAR.sql collapses to a WEIGHTED MEAN, `sum(x * actFract) / sum(actFract)` (ZoneMonthHour by MonthWeighting; MonthGroupHour, e10FuelProperties, ATBaseEmissions by MonthGroupWeighting): `weight / weight_total` when the run aggregates by year, and on any other run 1 at the cell's own month and 0 elsewhere -- a mean over one month is that month.",
      "params": [
        "aggregates_months",
        "is_own_month",
        "weight",
        "weight_total"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "ifelse",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": ">",
            "args": [
              "aggregates_months",
              0.5
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "ifelse",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": ">",
                "args": [
                  "weight_total",
                  0.0
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "/",
                "args": [
                  "weight",
                  "weight_total"
                ]
              },
              0.0
            ]
          },
          "is_own_month"
        ]
      }
    },
    "fuel_supply_summing_process": {
      "description": "1 for a process whose calculator weights its rates by `FuelSupply.marketShare` -- BaseRateCalculator's sum over the formulations, and EvaporativePermeationCalculator.sql's `SUM(marketShare x fuelAdjustment)` -- and so carries PreAggYEAR.sql's summed share (0.334 at four months) into its emissions; 0 for fuel vapor venting (12) and fuel leaks (13), whose calculators (MultidayTankVaporVentingCalculator.sql, LiquidLeakingCalculator.sql) read no market share: venting reads the fuel only through TankFuelGenerator's AverageTankGasoline, whose RVP is a share-weighted MEAN, and leaks not at all (PLAN.md §7.3.68). Refueling is not a rate row; RefuelingLossCalculator.sql's own sums are `rff_averageRVP` and `rff_energyContent`.",
      "params": [
        "process_id"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "ifelse",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "==",
            "args": [
              "process_id",
              12.0
            ]
          },
          0.0,
          {
            "op": "ifelse",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "==",
                "args": [
                  "process_id",
                  13.0
                ]
              },
              0.0,
              1.0
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "year_captured_process": {
      "description": "1 for a process whose emissions a Year-aggregated capture checks: running exhaust (1), start exhaust (2), brake wear (9), tire wear (10), crankcase running, start and extended idle (15, 16, 17), extended idle (90) and auxiliary power (91) (`scale-county-timeagg-year`, PLAN.md §7.3.65); evaporative permeation, fuel vapor venting and fuel leaks (11, 12, 13) and refueling displacement and spillage (18, 19) (`scale-county-timeagg-processes-year`, PLAN.md §7.3.68) -- permeation as the EMPTY output MOVES writes, because TankTemperatureGenerator writes no AverageTankTemperature under the hour collapse (§7.3.64). Any other process under `aggregateBy` Year is refused (`run_yearUnportedSelected`).",
      "params": [
        "process_id"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "ifelse",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "==",
            "args": [
              "process_id",
              1.0
            ]
          },
          1.0,
          {
            "op": "ifelse",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "==",
                "args": [
                  "process_id",
                  2.0
                ]
              },
              1.0,
              {
                "op": "ifelse",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "==",
                    "args": [
                      "process_id",
                      9.0
                    ]
                  },
                  1.0,
                  {
                    "op": "ifelse",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "==",
                        "args": [
                          "process_id",
                          10.0
                        ]
                      },
                      1.0,
                      {
                        "op": "ifelse",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "==",
                            "args": [
                              "process_id",
                              11.0
                            ]
                          },
                          1.0,
                          {
                            "op": "ifelse",
                            "args": [
                              {
                                "op": "==",
                                "args": [
                                  "process_id",
                                  12.0
                                ]
                              },
                              1.0,
                              {
                                "op": "ifelse",
                                "args": [
                                  {
                                    "op": "==",
                                    "args": [
                                      "process_id",
                                      13.0
                                    ]
                                  },
                                  1.0,
                                  {
                                    "op": "ifelse",
                                    "args": [
                                      {
                                        "op": "==",
                                        "args": [
                                          "process_id",
                                          15.0
                                        ]
                                      },
                                      1.0,
                                      {
                                        "op": "ifelse",
                                        "args": [
                                          {
                                            "op": "==",
                                            "args": [
                                              "process_id",
                                              16.0
                                            ]
                                          },
                                          1.0,
                                          {
                                            "op": "ifelse",
                                            "args": [
                                              {
                                                "op": "==",
                                                "args": [
                                                  "process_id",
                                                  17.0
                                                ]
                                              },
                                              1.0,
                                              {
                                                "op": "ifelse",
                                                "args": [
                                                  {
                                                    "op": "==",
                                                    "args": [
                                                      "process_id",
                                                      18.0
                                                    ]
                                                  },
                                                  1.0,
                                                  {
                                                    "op": "ifelse",
                                                    "args": [
                                                      {
                                                        "op": "==",
                                                        "args": [
                                                          "process_id",
                                                          19.0
                                                        ]
                                                      },
                                                      1.0,
                                                      {
                                                        "op": "ifelse",
                                                        "args": [
                                                          {
                                                            "op": "==",
                                                            "args": [
                                                              "process_id",
                                                              90.0
                                                            ]
                                                          },
                                                          1.0,
                                                          {
                                                            "op": "ifelse",
                                                            "args": [
                                                              {
                                                                "op": "==",
                                                                "args": [
                                                                  "process_id",
                                                                  91.0
                                                                ]
                                                              },
                                                              1.0,
                                                              0.0
                                                            ]
                                                          }
                                                        ]
                                                      }
                                                    ]
                                                  }
                                                ]
                                              }
                                            ]
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "year_captured_pollutant": {
      "description": "1 for a pollutant `scale-county-timeagg-year` checks at every process `year_captured_process` names (PLAN.md §7.3.65): THC, CO and NOx (1, 2, 3), Atmospheric CO2 and Total Energy (90, 91), and brake and tire wear PM10 and PM2.5 (106, 107, 116, 117). The species the Year species captures check at running and start exhaust alone are `year_captured_species`'s (PLAN.md §7.3.69).",
      "params": [
        "pollutant_id"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "ifelse",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "==",
            "args": [
              "pollutant_id",
              1.0
            ]
          },
          1.0,
          {
            "op": "ifelse",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "==",
                "args": [
                  "pollutant_id",
                  2.0
                ]
              },
              1.0,
              {
                "op": "ifelse",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "==",
                    "args": [
                      "pollutant_id",
                      3.0
                    ]
                  },
                  1.0,
                  {
                    "op": "ifelse",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "==",
                        "args": [
                          "pollutant_id",
                          90.0
                        ]
                      },
                      1.0,
                      {
                        "op": "ifelse",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "==",
                            "args": [
                              "pollutant_id",
                              91.0
                            ]
                          },
                          1.0,
                          {
                            "op": "ifelse",
                            "args": [
                              {
                                "op": "==",
                                "args": [
                                  "pollutant_id",
                                  106.0
                                ]
                              },
                              1.0,
                              {
                                "op": "ifelse",
                                "args": [
                                  {
                                    "op": "==",
                                    "args": [
                                      "pollutant_id",
                                      107.0
                                    ]
                                  },
                                  1.0,
                                  {
                                    "op": "ifelse",
                                    "args": [
                                      {
                                        "op": "==",
                                        "args": [
                                          "pollutant_id",
                                          116.0
                                        ]
                                      },
                                      1.0,
                                      {
                                        "op": "ifelse",
                                        "args": [
                                          {
                                            "op": "==",
                                            "args": [
                                              "pollutant_id",
                                              117.0
                                            ]
                                          },
                                          1.0,
                                          0.0
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "year_captured_species": {
      "description": "1 for a (process, pollutant) pair the Year species captures check (`scale-county-timeagg-year-toxics`, `scale-county-timeagg-year-pm`; PLAN.md §7.3.69). At running exhaust (1): THC, CO and NOx, CH4 and N2O (1-6; 4 is no pollutant), benzene and ethanol (20, 21), 1,3-butadiene, formaldehyde, acetaldehyde and acrolein (24-27), NH3, SO2, NO, NO2 and HONO (30-34), the aromatics, alkanes and aldehydes 40-46, NMHC and NMOG (79, 80), TOG, VOC and NonHAPTOG (86-88), Atmospheric CO2 and Total Energy (90, 91), CO2 Equivalent (98), the PM species -- PM10 total (100), PM2.5 total, organic and elemental carbon (110-112), sulfate (115), non-EC PM and aerosol water (118, 119) -- and naphthalene gas (185). At start exhaust (2) the same set but NonHAPTOG (no start pair in MOVES): the gases `scale-county-timeagg-year-toxics` checks there, and N2O, CO2 Equivalent, the six ATRatio toxics 20, 21, 24-27 and the PM species, which `scale-county-timeagg-year-start-species` checks (PLAN.md §7.3.71). Written as ID ranges, each holding no other selectable pollutant. Every species at extended idle, APU and the crankcase processes stays counted (`runspecs/pending/scale-county-timeagg-year-toxics-idle.esm` measured them), as do the metals, dioxins, PAH particles and mechanism species.",
      "params": [
        "process_id",
        "pollutant_id"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "ifelse",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "or",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "and",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "==",
                    "args": [
                      "process_id",
                      1.0
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "or",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "and",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "<=",
                            "args": [
                              1.0,
                              "pollutant_id"
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "op": "<=",
                            "args": [
                              "pollutant_id",
                              3.0
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "op": "and",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "<=",
                            "args": [
                              5.0,
                              "pollutant_id"
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "op": "<=",
                            "args": [
                              "pollutant_id",
                              6.0
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "op": "and",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "<=",
                            "args": [
                              20.0,
                              "pollutant_id"
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "op": "<=",
                            "args": [
                              "pollutant_id",
                              21.0
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "op": "and",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "<=",
                            "args": [
                              24.0,
                              "pollutant_id"
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "op": "<=",
                            "args": [
                              "pollutant_id",
                              27.0
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "op": "and",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "<=",
                            "args": [
                              30.0,
                              "pollutant_id"
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "op": "<=",
                            "args": [
                              "pollutant_id",
                              34.0
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "op": "and",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "<=",
                            "args": [
                              40.0,
                              "pollutant_id"
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "op": "<=",
                            "args": [
                              "pollutant_id",
                              46.0
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "op": "and",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "<=",
                            "args": [
                              79.0,
                              "pollutant_id"
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "op": "<=",
                            "args": [
                              "pollutant_id",
                              80.0
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "op": "and",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "<=",
                            "args": [
