    "year_captured_idle_species": {
      "description": "1 for a (process, pollutant) pair `scale-county-timeagg-year-toxics-idle` checks (PLAN.md §7.3.72): at extended idle (90), auxiliary power (91) and crankcase running, start and extended idle (15, 16, 17), THC, CO and NOx (1-3), CH4 (5), benzene and ethanol (20, 21), 1,3-butadiene, formaldehyde, acetaldehyde and acrolein (24-27), NH3, SO2, NO, NO2 and HONO (30-34), the aromatics, alkanes and aldehydes 40-46, NMHC and NMOG (79, 80), TOG and VOC (86, 87), Atmospheric CO2 and Total Energy (90, 91), CO2 Equivalent (98) and naphthalene gas (185) -- the absences too: MOVES writes no crankcase running or start row (their parents are not selected), no NH3 at APU or crankcase extended idle, and the capture checks that the model writes none. Ethanol is selected at the crankcase running and start processes alone. Written as ID ranges, each holding no other selectable pollutant; N2O, NonHAPTOG, the metals, dioxins, PAH particles and mechanism species at these processes stay counted. A template of its own, beside `year_captured_species`, so that the two Year species captures' lists stay separate.",
