    "year_captured_minor_species": {
      "description": "1 for a (process, pollutant) pair `scale-county-timeagg-year-minor-species` checks (PLAN.md §7.3.74): at running, start, extended idle, APU and crankcase running, start and extended idle (1, 2, 90, 91, 15, 16, 17), the PM species -- naphthalene particle (23), nitrate and ammonium (35, 36), the PM2.5 elements chloride to iron (51-59), the PAH particles 68-78 and 81-84, PM10 total (100), PM2.5 total, organic and elemental carbon (110-112), sulfate (115), NonECPM and aerosol water (118, 119), PMOTHR, NCOM, TOM and the residual (121-124) -- and at running exhaust, the only process MOVES associates them with, the metals (60-63, 65-67) and dioxins/furans (130-146), which the capture checks ABSENT: the default database has no `sourceTypePolProcess` row for them, so MOVES writes no source-bin distribution, no distance-rate weighting and no row, and the model writes none. Written as ID ranges, each holding no other selectable pollutant. A template of its own, beside `year_captured_species` and `year_captured_idle_species`, so that the Year species captures' lists stay separate.",
